# A small job on a local model beside a hard one on the strongest, for
# the site's first-task box (site/get-started.html) and a social reel. A
# hard job is at work on +claude (Opus, max effort); a small one is typed
# for +local, which runs on Irie's own Ollama server once its preflight
# has checked the model's context and memory, and finishes.
# Film it with docs/demo/record.sh, then cut it with docs/demo/cut.sh;
# the steps are in docs/demo/README.md.
#
# In the sandbox the server is the repo's fakeollama and the agents are
# the stand-in, as for every profile: Irie's local path runs, no model does.
# irie-demo: local = ollama
#
# The first Show is followed by two Sleeps, as in close-the-window.reel:
# a window's first terminal can hold its drawing up on a busy Mac.
#
# The phone cut starts on the task bar as the task is typed, then cuts to
# the cards and the details of the one shown, which say local, and ends on
# the hard job, whose details say claude. The cuts leave out most of the
# small job's run, whose length is the stand-in's script's.
# cut: jump show:2+3.5 reached:done-1.5
# cut: site type-1.5 end reached:done+1.5
# cut: phone type-1.2 end
# cut: shot type-1.2 540 0 310
# cut: shot enter+0.5 540 0 160
# cut: caption type-1 enter+0.45 top Small job. Local model. | $0 per token.
# cut: caption enter+0.5 show:1#2-0.3 bottom Small job. Local model. | $0 per token.
# cut: caption show:1#2+0.2 end bottom Hard job: the strongest model.
# cut: readme show:2-0.3 show:1#2+1.5
# cut: sheet type+1.6 show:2+1.5 reached:done+0.8 show:1#2+1.2 end-0.4
Set Size 1024x640
Set Appearance light
Set Palette evergreen
Set Backdrop E9EBDF
Set TypingSpeed 55ms

Spawn @acme-billing +claude redesign the retry queue

Sleep 500ms
Show 1
Sleep 1s
Sleep 2.5s
Type "@acme-api +local fix a typo in the readme"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Wait working 30s
Sleep 500ms
Show 2
Wait done 40s
Sleep 2.5s
Show 1
Sleep 4s
